Feature: Scenarios of one feature with state

    Scenario: First scenario of one feature
        * Store A in the state of the scenario
        * Store A in the state by a class step
        * Meet the other feature
        * Verify A is in the state of the scenario

    Scenario: Second scenario of one feature
        * Store B in the state of the scenario
        * Store B in the state by a class step
        * Meet the other feature
        * Verify B is in the state of the scenario
